# Parent-onboarding variables ONLY — this is NOT a full inventory of
# pp-sketch's env (see src/interfaces/llm/llm.prompt.md, src/docs/*.md and
# the Railway service for the rest). Placeholders only; never commit a key.
#
# All four are required in staging AND production before deploying the
# onboarding release; startup fails without them (assertOnboardingEnv in
# src/main.ts, src/onboarding/onboarding.config.ts).

# Google AI Studio key. Google is reserved for the realtime onboarding
# classifier — never used by passage generation or quality gates.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ISO timestamp. Users created before it never see onboarding. Set it to the
# deploy timestamp of the onboarding release (#88).
ONBOARDING_CUTOFF=

# Classifier provider + model. Pinned id, never a -latest alias; a
# non-thinking model (thinking is disabled provider-side with
# reasoning_effort: 'none', which only 2.5 models accept). Migration notes:
# the REVIEW block in src/onboarding/onboarding.config.ts.
ONBOARDING_LLM_PROVIDER=google
ONBOARDING_LLM_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash-lite

# Dashboard origin every user-facing link is built from (referral links,
# staff dashboard links). Required; startup fails without it.
DASHBOARD_PUBLIC_URL=https://dashboard.padhaipal.com
